{"term": {"label": "信", "occurrences": 8, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "必", "id": "必"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "狂", "id": "狂"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "諸", "id": "諸"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "諸", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 1.6877697557040074, "source": "諸", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.2755564206061263, "source": "諸", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "諸", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 0.706940502692281, "source": "信", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.1124056108004454, "source": "信", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.7939518796819108, "source": "信", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "信", "target": "必"}, {"weight": 0.994622575144062, "source": "信", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.1124056108004454, "source": "信", "target": "亂"}, {"weight": 1.4000876832522264, "source": "信", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "必", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.681021528714291, "source": "必", "target": "狂"}, {"weight": 1.9878743481543455, "source": "亂", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "亂", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.9041650800285006, "source": "亂", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "去", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.074885725143975, "source": "狂", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 0.3884867715737465, "source": "何", "target": "言"}, {